## Suggested Agent Response Categories

| Awkward Case | Expected Response Category | Key Checks |
|---|---|---|
| Cancelled | Cancellation and refund confirmation | Confirm order will not ship, explain refund status, provide refund timeline |
| Delayed | Delay notification and empathy | Acknowledge delay, explain cause, provide revised ETA, offer next steps if available |
| Only partly sent | Split shipment communication | Explain shipped versus missing items, provide backorder ETA, confirm no extra charge if applicable |
| Lost | Lost-package investigation and resolution | Confirm investigation, explain claim status, offer replacement or refund according to policy |
| Bad address | Address correction and reshipment | Verify correct address, request missing details, explain reshipment or pickup options |

